join detective right
detective: What do you know about the guard?
join friend left
friend: I’m pretty angry at them.
friend: It was their job to protect Dracula, wasn’t it?
friend: …
friend: They were trying their best.
friend: They only stopped guarding the door twice the whole night.
friend: Once when Dracula gave showed them around the manor before his last dessert.
friend: And once more when I insisted they come inside after Dracula fainted.
friend: They were very devoted to their role, I suppose.
friend: …
friend: I still can’t say I like them, though.
